<title>JAPAN: Sumitomo Seika falls on stop-loss selling.</title>
<headline>Sumitomo Seika falls on stop-loss selling.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sumitomo Seika Chemicals Co Ltd shares fell in early Thursday morning trade due to stop-loss selling by investors, brokers said.</p>
<p>As of 0101 GMT, the shares were down 25 yen at 860 yen.</p>
